cert-manager|jetstack|https://charts.jetstack.io|cert-manager|v1.17.1|cert-manager
metrics-server|metrics-server|https://kubernetes-sigs.github.io/metrics-server|metrics-server|3.12.2|kube-system
kube-prometheus-stack|prometheus-community|https://prometheus-community.github.io/helm-charts|kube-prometheus-stack|69.8.2|monitoring
aws-ebs-csi-driver|aws-ebs-csi-driver|https://kubernetes-sigs.github.io/aws-ebs-csi-driver|aws-ebs-csi-driver|2.41.0|kube-system
